    "caption": "🎮 Get a chance to accelerate your game by participating in the acceleration program by Astana Hub’s partner — WePlay Hub!\n\n💎 WePlay Hub is one of the biggest acceleration program in Europe, Turkey and Central Asia.\n\n ⚡️WePlay Hub is a 3-month program with a unique opportunity for selected gaming studios to get access to technical and business know-how, valuable mentorship, and strategic partnerships. In addition, they offer an investment opportunity of up to 300K USD for gaming studios that have completed the program successfully and have shown exponential success and traction.\n\n🔥 The WePlay Hub Acceleration Program is remote and conducted in English. It is tailored to support early-stage gaming studios with global scaling potential, who are developing games for all platforms, including Mobile, Console, PC, and Web3. They are looking for studios with a minimum of 4 members in the team, who are at the pre-seed or seed stage and are based in the regions covered by their program. \n\n❕ Application deadline May, 31st. You can register by the link in the profile description (taplink).",
